    <bpmn:process id="W_W786" name="W786. DC-to-Store Delivery Route Optimization &amp; Multi-Stop Planning" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Daily dispatch planning cycle; or weekly route optimization review
Frequency: Daily route planning; weekly optimization review
Volume: 4 DCs × ~4–10 delivery routes per DC per day = ~15–40 route plans/day, each route serving ~2–3 stores (consistent with the ~2,000–2,600 monthly delivery canon)
Owner: Logistics Planner
Participants: Logistics Planner, DC Dispatcher, Fleet Manager, 3PL Carrier Coordinator
Source: workflow W786 — DC-to-Store Delivery Route Optimization &amp; Multi-Stop Planning</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W786_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W786_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W786_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W786_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W786_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W786_Lane2" name="Logistics Planner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W786_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W786_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W786_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W786_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W786_Lane3" name="DC Dispatcher">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W786_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W786_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W786_Start5" name="Daily dispatch planning cycle; or weekly route optimization review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W786_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W786_Task6" name="Daily order-to-store assignment">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Daily order-to-store assignment: System groups approved transfer orders by delivery date and DC: (a) priority orders (perishable, promotional stock per W57, emergency per W596), (b) standard replenishment orders, (c) store delivery time windows (7AM-5PM standard; some LGU truck ban restrictions per W431)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Logistics Planner
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W786_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W786_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W786_Task7" name="Route optimization run">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Route optimization run: Logistics Planner runs route optimization: (a) inputs: store locations per W310 geographic master, order volumes per store (cubic meters, weight), truck capacity (6-wheeler: 5 tons / 20 CBM; 10-wheeler: 10 tons / 40 CBM), delivery time windows, LGU truck ban hours per W431, traffic pattern data; (b) constraints: max 8-hour route duration, max 3 stops per route (for manageable unloading time), refrigerated/hazmat items on compliant trucks per W699; (c) outputs: optimized route plans minimizing total distance and time
Responsible (R): Logistics Planner
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30-60 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W786_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W786_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W786_Task8" name="Route plan review and adjustment">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Route plan review and adjustment: Logistics Planner reviews system-generated routes: (a) verify priority orders on earliest routes, (b) balance loads across available trucks (owned per W52 + 3PL per W242), (c) adjust for known road closures or construction, (d) confirm driver availability per W654 certification, (e) finalize dispatch sequence
Responsible (R): Logistics Planner
Accountable (A): DC Ops Manager
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W786_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W786_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W786_Task9" name="Driver and carrier assignment">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Driver and carrier assignment: DC Dispatcher assigns: (a) owned fleet drivers per W197 driver management, (b) 3PL carriers per W242 contract and W727 daily performance, (c) provide driver with: route plan, store contact numbers, delivery documents (manifest, transfer orders), GPS device per W199 telematics
Responsible (R): DC Dispatcher
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W786_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W786_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W786_Task10" name="Real-time route monitoring">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Real-time route monitoring: Throughout delivery day: (a) Logistics Planner monitors fleet via telematics per W199, (b) tracks on-time delivery vs. planned schedule, (c) reroutes for traffic incidents or road closures, (d) communicates delays to receiving stores per W708
Responsible (R): Logistics Planner
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Continuous during delivery hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W786_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W786_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W786_Task11" name="Delivery completion reconciliation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Delivery completion reconciliation: End of delivery day: (a) system reconciles planned vs. actual deliveries per route, (b) records on-time delivery rate, (c) captures store receipt confirmations per W109, (d) logs route exceptions (missed deliveries, access issues, partial deliveries)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Logistics Planner
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W786_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W786_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W786_Task12" name="Weekly route optimization review">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Weekly route optimization review: Logistics Planner analyzes: (a) average stops per route, (b) average delivery time per stop, (c) truck utilization rate (target ≥ 85%), (d) on-time delivery rate by route and carrier, (e) fuel consumption per delivery per W198, (f) route efficiency improvement opportunities (store clustering, time window optimization)
Responsible (R): Logistics Planner
Accountable (A): Fleet Manager
Duration: 2 hours/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W786_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W786_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W786_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W786_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W786_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-245 (ensure controlled execution — Supply Chain Orchestration &amp; Risk (PA-02.3).) | - operational: Logistics Planner review and approval gate; operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: Logistics Planner</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
